  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      202.97,
      397.2,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)to provide study materials, equipments anddeucation facilities for the law income families anddifferently abled children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      250.97,
      397.17,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)to assist schools and educational institutes in thefields of Sports and Information Technology;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      286.97,
      397.2,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)to provide youth with opportunities for LeadershipTraining by organizing workshops, lectures,seminars, exhibitions, orientation programs, teachertraining programs in order to promote knowledgeas the most effective means to address the challengesof contemporary society;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      370.97,
      397.2,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "(e)to create facilities for Sinhalese to learn TamilLanguage and Tamils to learn Sinhalese and foreveryone to learn English, thus removingthe language barrier and promote betterunderstanding among different ethnic groups andlead them towards inter-cultural, inter-religious andinter-ethnic relationships;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      466.97,
      397.18,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(f)to establish opportunities for Vocational Trainingand skills development;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      502.97,
      397.18,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(g)to bring about a sustainable development bymaking an awareness in children on preservationof environment and cultivate a habit of plantingtrees;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      562.97,
      397.2,
      586.31
    ],
    "text": "(h)to establish library facilities and implementTelevision and Radio Educational Programms;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      598.97,
      397.18,
      622.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)to conduct eye, blood donation and medical campsto help out children in low income families;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      634.97,
      397.19,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(j)to do all such other acts, matters and things as areincidental or conductive to the attainment of theobjectives of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
